2026-07-27T10:43:07.2457598Z i /tmp/RtmppfvYTz/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2458035Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2458545Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2458990Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2459688Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2460737Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:43:07.2461874Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
